; 魔女裁判 第2章4話
; ========================================

# Scene2-4-1

; ========================================
; ●シーン2-4‐1
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:11_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@ShowToastUI Text:"第２部　第４章|#Toast_109|"
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_9_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Angry1
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:好沉闷啊！！<br>各位，气氛太沉闷了哦！！|#0204Adv01_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那天早餐后，<br>我们应雪莉的召集，聚集到了娱乐室。|#0204Adv01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉、汉娜、蕾雅、米莉亚、<br>亚里沙、艾玛，还有——我，共七人。|#0204Adv01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被囚禁在这个监牢中的少女……<br>已经有六个人遭遇了悲剧，<br>不在人世了。|#0204Adv01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Open

[PrintTextModified Text:这种状况下还让我们故作轻松？<br>说实话，光是遵守规定生活下去，<br>我就已经竭尽全力了哇……|#0204Adv01_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经再也不想思考了……<br>我真的，太累了。|#0204Adv01_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜那痛苦的低喃，<br>恰如其分地道出了我们的心声。|#0204Adv01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家只是机械性地听从召集来到这里，<br>每个人的表情和气氛都一样沉重。|#0204Adv01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:说说你把大家叫来的目的吧，<br>雪莉。|#0204Adv01_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就连一向健谈的蕾雅，<br>眼眶下也长出了黑眼圈，眼中的光彩也不复从前。|#0204Adv01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（即使已经对这座监牢进行了事无巨细的调查，<br>　我们却始终没有找到任何有效的应对手段）|#0204Adv01_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（所谓的大魔女……真的存在吗？）|#0204Adv01_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（包括我自己在内……都快要撑不下去了）|#0204Adv01_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv01_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其中最明显的是艾玛。<br>最近，她几乎不再露出笑容了。|#0204Adv01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（艾玛是故意想让我担心……<br>　不，不对）|#0204Adv01_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我越来越搞不懂了。<br>无论是关于艾玛，还是我自己。|#0204Adv01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为搞不懂，我只能有意地不去关注她。|#0204Adv01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎是想要驱散沉闷的空气，<br>雪莉“啪”地一声，拍了拍手。|#0204Adv01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Wait WaitMode:1.0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:今天，我打算和大家一起玩点什么！|#0204Adv01_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们的压力越大，就会越快变成魔女，<br>所以最好的办法就是开开心心地度过每一天！<br>大家振作起来吧！|#0204Adv01_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……原来如此，这个提议倒是不坏。|#0204Adv01_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:那我们玩什么呢？<br>这里可以看电影，<br>还有台球和西洋棋。|#0204Adv01_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04

[PrintTextModified Text:但这些游戏，好像都没办法让大家振作起来呢……|#0204Adv01_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:不一定要玩这里有的东西，<br>我想，可以玩一些大家一起参加的游戏！|#0204Adv01_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:比如说呢……嗯～<br>玩躲避球，或者捉迷藏什么的！|#0204Adv01_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:全是些让人不想和你这种人玩的游戏哇！？|#0204Adv01_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:娱乐室会被你弄坏的！|#0204Adv01_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02

[PrintTextModified Text:不用算我了。<br>说过多少次了，我可没兴趣和你们搞好关系。|#0204Adv01_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙很快就冷淡地丢下这句话，<br>转身准备离开。|#0204Adv01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆煽り笑い
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～，你是不是已经知道自己怎么都赢不了我，<br>所以才打算逃跑呢？噗噗～|#0204Adv01_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:……你说什么？|#0204Adv01_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙的脚步猛地停住了。<br>她回过头，狠狠地瞪着雪莉。|#0204Adv01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:要比什么？快点决定吧。|#0204Adv01_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed02,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呦！不错哦～！<br>那就选个准备起来不麻烦的项目吧，<br>比如说——掰手腕！|#0204Adv01_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:允许使用魔法的无限制比赛……<br>就叫【魔法掰手腕】吧！！|#0204Adv01_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:很好，我接受挑战。|#0204Adv01_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（真是单纯至极。<br>　就这么彻底中了雪莉的计）|#0204Adv01_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无奈地叹了口气，<br>环顾了一下在场的众人，<br>却发现她们的眼神里似乎恢复了一丝光彩。|#0204Adv01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……算了，就陪她们玩玩吧）|#0204Adv01_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我向前踏出一步。|#0204Adv01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:那就由我来当裁判吧。<br>因为我不是魔女，无法使用魔法。|#0204Adv01_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和你们可不一样。|#0204Adv01_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……哼，还在说这种话？<br>差不多该承认了吧？|#0204Adv01_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:我朝她狠狠地瞪了一眼，汉娜立刻闭上了嘴。|#0204Adv01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:好了好了，魔女也好，不是魔女也罢，<br>现在都不重要。<br>还是开开心心地玩游戏吧！|#0204Adv01_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

