[PrintTextModified Text:……于是，<br>我们决定来一场<br>雪莉发明的【魔法掰手腕】——|#0204Adv01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对实力碾压级的雪莉，<br>少女们决定所有人一起挑战。|#0204Adv01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_8_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:哼哼哼，尽管来挑战我吧～|#0204Adv01_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉早已是一副王者风范，<br>悠然自得地半倚在沙发上，露出自信的微笑。|#0204Adv01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:笑得出来也就现在了。|#0204Adv01_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和亚里沙隔着矮桌，<br>各自摆好架势。|#0204Adv01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:准备好了吗？|#0204Adv01_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL11,Angle01/Option_ArmL+
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:双方目光交汇的瞬间，<br>霎时火花四溅。|#0204Adv01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……这不是比喻，亚里沙手中真的燃起了火焰。|#0204Adv01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.

[PrintTextModified Text:……开始！|#0204Adv01_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL11,Angle01/Option_ArmL+
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Angry1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:裁判一声令下的同时，双方的手猛然碰撞。|#0204Adv01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 目を見開く
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL11,Angle01/Option_ArmL+

[PrintTextModified Text:没人能赢得了我的火焰！|#0204Adv01_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是打算用高温让对手失去战斗力吧！|#0204Adv01_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然略显卑鄙，但这样一来，就算是雪莉也——|#0204Adv01_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 受け身の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_116 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:——砰！|#0204Adv01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,ArmL4,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:呃啊！|#0204Adv01_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——刚交手一瞬间、<br>亚里沙就被轻易压倒。|#0204Adv01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1,ArmR8

@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:好烫好烫！|#0204Adv01_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而雪莉的手直接伸进了火焰中，<br>也被轻微烧伤。|#0204Adv01_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:胜者，橘雪莉！|#0204Adv01_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,ArmL4,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:可恶……实在太强了……|#0204Adv01_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆「勝てないだろう」の意

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（这根本赢不了好不好）|#0204Adv01_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉拥有【怪力】的魔法。<br>这可不是谁都能战胜的——|#0204Adv01_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

