@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚也遗憾退场……|#0204Adv01_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:胜者，橘雪莉！|#0204Adv01_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000ff Duration:0.4 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.4
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0.4 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来，你们也太弱了吧？？<br>啊，原来是雪莉我的魔法太强了！<br>啊哈哈哈，最强真是抱歉啦！|#0204Adv01_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:可恶，不甘心哇，太不甘心了——！|#0204Adv01_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜气得直跺脚，<br>而雪莉则得意洋洋地靠在沙发上。|#0204Adv01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:只剩下艾玛了。<br>拜托了，一定要赢雪莉！|#0204Adv01_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……欸？啊，嗯。|#0204Adv01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直在不远处旁观的艾玛，<br>终于走上前来。|#0204Adv01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，意思就是要和雪莉<br>掰手腕……对吧？|#0204Adv01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她似乎还没搞清楚状况。|#0204Adv01_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（果然，艾玛有点不对劲）|#0204Adv01_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:哦？原来艾玛还没比呢！<br>但怎么看都不可能赢我吧！<br>哈哈哈，哈哈哈哈！！|#0204Adv01_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:可恶，这猩猩女也太嚣张了！|#0204Adv01_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜忿忿不平，眼里含着泪光，<br>走到艾玛身边。|#0204Adv01_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:一定、一定要赢哇，艾玛！|#0204Adv01_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我会加油的……！|#0204Adv01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是能让艾玛获胜的魔法哦。|#0204Adv01_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:45 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:说着，汉娜<br>轻轻用双手包裹住了艾玛的手。<br>似乎是偷偷动了些手脚。|#0204Adv01_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:……你们两个准备好了吗？|#0204Adv01_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:随时放马过来吧！|#0204Adv01_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我准备好了……！<br>好，我会赢的！|#0204Adv01_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:在我下达开始的指令后，<br>在桌子中央双方开始交手。<br>紧接着——|#0204Adv01_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是UFO！|#0204Adv01_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅大喊了一声，<br>所有人不由自主地<br>看向了毫不相关的地方。|#0204Adv01_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在大家移开视线那一瞬间……|#0204Adv01_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; 受け身の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_116 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:2.0

[PrintTextModified Text:——被压倒的是，<br>雪莉。|#0204Adv01_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:……咦？|#0204Adv01_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_9_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Hanna Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了太好了！成功了，艾玛！|#0204Adv01_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，呃……嗯。|#0204Adv01_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我趁雪莉被UFO转移注意力、手上力量放松的空隙，<br>把雪莉压倒了，大概……？|#0204Adv01_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（是蕾雅的杰作吗……）|#0204Adv01_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（原来灵活运用魔法，<br>　能产生这么出人意料的效果）|#0204Adv01_Hiro021|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:好啦好啦，赢了就是好事！<br>雪莉，你已不再是王者！<br>快从那王座上退下来吧！|#0204Adv01_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Angry1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:咕呜呜……我不服！<br>再比一次，我要再比一次！|#0204Adv01_Sherry016| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:干脆点，认输吧。<br>这场比赛是艾玛赢了。|#0204Adv01_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:我说完，自然而然地和艾玛对上了视线。|#0204Adv01_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:赢过了不断挑衅的雪莉，<br>老实说，我也感到有些痛快。|#0204Adv01_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:忍不住露出了一抹<br>赞赏艾玛的笑容。|#0204Adv01_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仿佛回到了过去，<br>回到了我们天真无邪、<br>欢笑不断的时光——|#0204Adv01_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:我猛地回过神，连忙用手掩住嘴巴，忍住了笑容。|#0204Adv01_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:（我在干什么啊……）|#0204Adv01_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢各位让我看了一场好戏。<br>那么我就告辞了。|#0204Adv01_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我转身背对众人，<br>快步离开了房间。|#0204Adv01_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

