[PrintTextModified Text:觉得快乐，<br>就已是罪孽深重——|#0204Adv01_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:胸口传来一阵疼痛，<br>我在门前握紧了拳头。|#0204Adv01_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:长长的指甲深深嵌入了掌心。<br>明明今早才刚剪过的。|#0204Adv01_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（明明已经平息下来了，以为自己能控制住了……<br>　可是——）|#0204Adv01_Hiro025|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:脑海中浮现出<br>奈叶香的话。|#0204Adv01_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]


